  "execution_path_review": [
    "dist/index.js exports inventory APIs. system() dispatches by the host platform to linux/system.js on Linux and BSD. The probes are inside the async API body.",
    "linux/system.js clones initSystem, executes dmidecode, fills missing properties from DMI sysfs through readSysfsMany -> readSysfs -> readFile, and cleans placeholder values.",
    "Model/manufacturer, disk identifiers, dmesg, WSL release strings and Docker marker files populate result.virtual, virtualHost, model and manufacturer. The function returns result. No VM-dependent process exit or payload execution is present.",
    "The common exec module wraps child_process exec/execFile with promisify and provides bounded spawn helpers; these run OS inventory commands. getStaticData invokes the si.* queries with Promise.all and returns their properties.",
    "common/windows.js Base64-encodes each caller-supplied PowerShell inventory query as UTF-8, transmits a wrapper over child stdin, decodes it with FromBase64String, invokes ScriptBlock.Create, and parses returned JSON and job-end markers. This transport is unchanged from beta.17.",
    "common/internet.js checks caller-supplied website URLs with GET and discovers the public IP with OpenDNS, falling back to ipify. It does not send the hardware report. Docker sockets are used for container statistics.",
    "The package is readable TypeScript compiler output, including ordinary CommonJS import helpers and comma-expression calls. No concealed code delta or encoded hostile stage was found.",
    "PMD in common/mappings.js is the USB vendor PMD Solutions. element.value in docker.js is a Docker block-I/O statistics record, not a browser form value."
  ],
