    "matcher_corrections": [
      "si.* inventory observations now require exact structured calls rather than comments, strings or longer lookalike targets.",
      "Bare diskdrive is consolidated into the existing case-insensitive Win32_DiskDrive class reference, with JavaScript/TypeScript support.",
      "Generic element.value is consolidated into the canonical value-member capability; its matcher uses structured member facts. Form composites retain their other browser context.",
      "The pmd process-name matcher requires a complete image token, excluding PMD Solutions and scoped package names."
